  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958291/description_31da0c1a-3425-4a56-b9ff-8795113b90fd.png\" alt=\"Crate Delight\"></p>\n<p><strong>使用木箱和袋子扩展您的储物空间，让物品管理更轻松！</strong> Crate Delight 让您能够制作木箱和袋子，以优雅的方式整理资源，保持箱子整洁有序，背包井井有条。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-fabric/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1&showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"Download 26.1 update\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9HxDzV.png\" alt=\"Fabric Download\"></a></p>\n<h2>🍎 功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>木箱：</strong> 可以存储苹果、甜浆果、鸡蛋、生鲑鱼、生鳕鱼、发光浆果、金苹果等大量物品！</li>\n<li><strong>袋子：</strong> 适用于可可豆、糖、火药等物品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🛠️ 附加模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrate-delight-croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crate Delight: Croptopia</a>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n<li>为 Croptopia 添加了超过 50 种新的木箱和袋子。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"Saving for a laptop!\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Support Me Button\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Donate Button\"></a>